00:30:26.970 --> 00:30:28.510
So we have groups set up there.

00:30:28.510 --> 00:30:31.350
And then those groups
have certain privileges

00:30:31.350 --> 00:30:33.300
in Google Cloud Dashboard.

00:30:33.300 --> 00:30:35.550
So that's the way that
we manage our users

00:30:35.550 --> 00:30:40.020
and make sure that no one should
be doing what they are not

00:30:40.020 --> 00:30:40.752
allowed to do.

